    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061127.0017\n\nMANILA, Nov. 27 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nPhilippine stocks close flat\n\n\n\n\nPhilippine stock prices closed flat on Monday with a sluggish session in absence of strong leads, dealers said.\n\nThe 30-company composite index was down only 0.28 point at 2, 817.56.\n\nThe broader all-shares index rose 0.39 point to 1,759.88.\n\nLosers beat gainers 55 to 46, while 61 stocks ended unchanged.\n\nTrade volume was 4.09 billion shares valued at 2.25 billion pesos (45.3 million U.S. dollars).",
